  "description": "<h1>SPTarkovSpeedLoader</h1>\n<p>magazine speed-loader for SPTarkov</p>\n<p>will increase magazine’s ammo load speed when your <strong>special slot</strong> have any <strong>Leatherman Multitool</strong></p>\n<p>the initial idea was to add a new item, but i didn’t have the necessary skills that to made a new 3D model</p>\n<h3>coefficient</h3>\n<p>when:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>default server settings (0.85 second)</li>\n<li>Mag Drills Lv.9 (-5.4% modify)</li>\n<li>the magazine is 6L31 (60 round 5.45x39 that with +85% modify)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>the base coefficient is <code>0.85 * (1.0 - 0.054 + 0.85)</code> =&gt; <code>1.5266</code></p>\n<p>each tool provides <strong>50%</strong> speed coefficient, use multiplication instead of addition</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>tool count</th>\n<th>final speed</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1.52 second</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.76 second</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0.38 second</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>0.19 second</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>limit</h3>\n<p>min load speed is 0.025, too fast will cause load action exception that make you can not load ammo in the raid any more</p>\n<h3>source of idea</h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/ragnaroks/SPTarkovSpeedLoader/raw/master/Assets/idea.jpg\" alt=\"idea\" /></p>\n",
